      "summary_sent_score": 0.2753097712993622
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "His earlier application was dismissed as withdrawn.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 690,
      "end": 741,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3030999004840851
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The applicant has been arrested on 27/06/2024 by Police Station Rithi, District Katni in connection with Crime No.222/2024 for the offence punishable under Sections 363, 366, 376(2)(N), 376, 334,\n506 of IPC and Sections 3 r/w 4, 5 r/w 6 of POCSO Act.\nLearned counsel appearing for the applicant submits that this repeat application has been filed on the ground that applicant is in custody since 27/06/2024 i.e. more than 6 months and he is the only earning member of the family.",
