    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Applicant is a young boy aged about 21 years and he has not committed any offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1223,
      "end": 1305,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28489255905151367
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "It is further submitted that now the statement of NEUTRAL CITATION NO.\n2024:MPHC-JBP:60950 2 MCRC-52462-2024 victim is recorded before the Trial Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1306,
      "end": 1457,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "NEUTRAL CITATION NO.",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1356,
          "end": 1377
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17904317378997803
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "He is ready to abide by all the terms and conditions that may be imposed while considering the bail application of the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1458,
      "end": 1587,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3069990277290344
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Under these circumstances, prayer for grant of bail is made out.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1588,
      "end": 1652,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20764213800430298
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The State counsel has vehemently opposed the bail application and prays for rejection of this repeat bail application.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1653,
      "end": 1772,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2903452217578888
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "It is submitted that the victim has supported the prosecution case in her statement Kashi @ Veeru Patel vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 12 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/160975880/\n1 recorded before the Trial Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1773,
      "end": 2018,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Kashi @ Veeru Patel vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1857,
          "end": 1907
        },
        {
          "text": "12 December, 2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1911,
          "end": 1928
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4067448079586029
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "Therefore, no case for grant of bail is made out.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2019,
      "end": 2068,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.42749884724617004
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The statement of victim is recorded before the Trial Court and she has supported the prosecution case in toto.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2070,
      "end": 2180,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.44212308526039124
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Merely the custody period cannot be a sole ground for release of applicant on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2181,
      "end": 2264,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5044594407081604
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "Even otherwise, applicant is in custody only since 27/06/2024.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2265,
      "end": 2327,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "27/06/2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2316,
          "end": 2326
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3804311752319336
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "Therefore, considering the aforesaid facts of the case, this Court is of considered opinion that no case for grant of bail is made out.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2328,
      "end": 2463,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.42920616269111633
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "Accordingly, this second bail application is dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2464,
      "end": 2520,
      "entities": [],
